S122 phase 1's guard plants, never committed: one build of the landing with this patch applied
picks one defect at run time, S122_PLANT=N, and -DS122_FORCED builds it at forced curve
weights instead of the seed (adocs/data/S122_phase1_plants.sh runs each against its guard;
the S122 step file's "Guards, each seen red on a plant" has the table). Applies to S122's
phase 1 landing.
  1 Black's storm walked the wrong way          2 Black's check guard ignores Black's pawns
  3 Black's weak squares ignore Black's guard   4 Black's defended squares take its rooks
  5 both colours' contact clause dropped        6 both colours' defenders read knights only
  7 the trace records White's knight attackers' curve input one too high
  8 exact_parts() divides the curve by twice its divisor
  9 exact_parts() takes Black's T with White's sign
 10 gradient() does not silence the curve on a bound row
 11 smooth() adds the curve after the clamp
 13 (with -DS122_FORCED) the engine divides the curve by 4096

